# CHIN-UP

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Chin-Up is a bodyweight vertical pulling exercise performed using a supinated grip.

Within CAS, it is considered a foundational exercise for developing relative upper-body strength, elbow flexor strength and vertical pulling capacity.

---

# Philosophy

The Chin-Up emphasizes efficient pulling mechanics while increasing the contribution of the elbow flexors.

Compared with the Pull-Up, it is generally more accessible for novice athletes while still providing excellent transfer to combat sports.

CAS selects the Chin-Up when improving relative pulling strength and movement quality.

