# Scientific Evidence

Evidence Level

★★★★★

The Chin-Up is strongly supported for developing upper-body relative strength, elbow flexor strength and vertical pulling performance. It is particularly valuable as a progression toward weighted vertical pulling exercises.

---

# Explainability

Example

The Chin-Up is selected because it improves relative pulling strength while allowing efficient progression toward heavier vertical pulling exercises. Its movement pattern transfers directly to grip fighting, clinch control and grappling performance.

